# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic: docs/errors.md is compared byte-for-byte against generated output
# by tests/unit/test_error_taxonomy.py. A CRLF checkout would fail that test on a
# fresh clone on Windows while passing in Linux CI -- the worst kind of failure,
# because it looks like the generator is broken.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ico  binary
